<title>MALAYSIA: Kamunting year net 102.45 mln rgt.</title>
<headline>Kamunting year net 102.45 mln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to March 31, '97</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 102.45   vs	  55.11</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 13.0    vs	   7.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		   196.94   vs	 164.76</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   146.00   vs	  87.63</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  0.16   vs  less   0.62</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    1.55   vs	   4.66</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	 0.5    vs	   0.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Kamunting Corp Bhd is involved in property development, general insurance and other financial services.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
</text>
